# Database & Migrations

- Source of truth for structure while coding: **`database/schema.sql`**
- Schema changes: create `database/migrations/YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_description.sql` (TiDB Cloud Serverless / MySQL 8.0 compatible)
- After apply: update `database/schema.sql` to match
- Apply with `npm run db:migrate` (tracks `schema_migrations`)
- Credentials: `.env` (`DB_HOST`, `DB_PORT`, `DB_USER`, `DB_PASSWORD`, `DB_NAME`, `DB_SSL`)
- Learners, staff, and company buyers keep separate login-code and session tables
- Map DB errors to friendly API responses (409 duplicate, 400 FK) — never leak raw MySQL/TiDB messages
